      "address": "9695 Basil Western Rd., Canal Winchester, OH 43110",
      "description": "Emergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line   Serving more than 15,000 patients a year, the MedVet Diley Hill team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers on the Southeast side of Columbus in Fairfield and Franklin counties and the surrounding areas.   We serve as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced, comprehensive veterinary emergency care. You’ll find caregivers with the expertise and state-of-the-art resources to diagnose and treat your beloved pet during critical times. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you each step of the way as we work to deliver the best outcome for your pet.   If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed.  ",
